stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: анкета редактируется
    Draft --> Armed: анкета валидна, датчик готов,\nкамера ready если videoRequested
    Armed --> Starting: одна кнопка «Начать»
    Starting --> Recording: получен первый пакет\nи первый frame при видео
    Starting --> Failed: timeout / камера / BLE
    Recording --> Finalizing: одна кнопка «Завершить»
    Recording --> Interrupted: background / crash / disconnect
    Finalizing --> Completed: writers closed,\nMP4 валиден, hashes рассчитаны
    Finalizing --> Failed: обязательный artifact повреждён
    Completed --> UploadPending
    Interrupted --> UploadPending
    Failed --> UploadPending
    UploadPending --> Uploading
    Uploading --> UploadPending: retryable error
    Uploading --> Synced: server complete подтвердил\nразмеры и SHA-256
    Uploading --> UploadFailed: permanent auth/data error
